s&rsv_dl=fyb_news"},{"title":"西乙一球员与对方门将相撞 伤重离世","desc":"西班牙足球运动员德·米格尔在比赛中与对方门将发生严重碰撞，因伤势过重离世，年仅30岁。西班牙特内里费俱乐部当地时间11月3日发布声明，确认德·米格尔于当天上午在医院去世。","cover":"https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/a10343c426ba4c5c8975f861c386cb89","hot":"6944138","url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%A5%BF%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%80%E7%90%83%E5%91%98%E4%B8%8E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E9%97%A8%E5%B0%86%E7%9B%B8%E6%92%9E+%E4%BC%A4%E9%87%8D%E7%A6%BB%E4%B8%96&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news","mobile_url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%A5%BF%E4%B9%99%E4%B8%80%E7%90%83%E5%91%98%E4%B8%8E%E5%AF%B9%E6%96%B9%E9%97%A8%E5%B0%86%E7%9B%B8%E6%92%9E+%E4%BC%A4%E9%87%8D%E7%A6%BB%E4%B8%96&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"},{"title":"网传“四川一机场飞机着火”不实","desc":"近日，网传四川一机场飞机起火。经核实，视频里橙红色光晕实为飞机着陆灯光线散射加拍摄过曝所致，机场并无航空器险情。","cover":"https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/9c9c1caeccc6ed56a8c2d4ae78148ca6","hot":"6855373","url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BD%91%E4%BC%A0%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%9B%E5%B7%9D%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9C%BA%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E7%9D%80%E7%81%AB%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9E&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news","mobile_url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BD%91%E4%BC%A0%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%9B%E5%B7%9D%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9C%BA%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E7%9D%80%E7%81%AB%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9E&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"},{"title":"感染终身携带 这种病毒进入高发期","desc":"近期，带状疱疹进入高发期。该病由水痘-带状疱疹病毒引发，被称作 “最疼皮肤病”。初次感染儿童多出水痘或隐性感染；病毒无法被彻底清除，会潜伏在神经节内，一旦感染就终身携带。","cover":"https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/3f99eb719f04ad992447f098a076e01c","hot":"6755912","url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%84%9F%E6%9F%93%E7%BB%88%E8%BA%AB%E6%90%BA%E5%B8%A6+%E8%BF%99%E7%A7%8D%E7%97%85%E6%AF%92%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E9%AB%98%E5%8F%91%E6%9C%9F&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news","mobile_url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%84%9F%E6%9F%93%E7%BB%88%E8%BA%AB%E6%90%BA%E5%B8%A6+%E8%BF%99%E7%A7%8D%E7%97%85%E6%AF%92%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E9%AB%98%E5%8F%91%E6%9C%9F&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"},{"title":"俄方：俄美乌三方会谈时间定了","desc":"当地时间11月3日，俄罗斯总统新闻秘书佩斯科夫在回答提问时证实，俄罗斯、美国和乌克兰三方谈判将于11月10日至11日在阿联酋阿布扎比举行。","cover":"https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/df156b534b6bcf7ce40dea32418e229d","hot":"6667172","url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BF%84%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E4%B9%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E4%BC%9A%E8%B0%88%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%86&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news","mobile_url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BF%84%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%9A%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E4%B9%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E4%BC%9A%E8%B0%88%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%AE%9A%E4%BA%86&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"},{"title":"冰箱的冻肉超过这个时间立马扔","desc":"冷冻并非永久保鲜，零下18℃环境里畜禽肉可存4到12个月，水产保质期更短。久冻会让脂肪氧化、口感变柴，温度波动易滋生细菌，出现异味或反复化冻的肉，建议直接丢弃，勿因舍不得而影响健康。","cover":"https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/2bd64320f4bd5c9ba7b715559c0f8a03","hot":"6563467","url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%86%B0%E7%AE%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%86%BB%E8%82%89%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%AB%8B%E9%A9%AC%E6%89%94&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news","mobile_url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%86%B0%E7%AE%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%86%BB%E8%82%89%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%AB%8B%E9%A9%AC%E6%89%94&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"},{"title":"花了一等座的钱 全程却只能站着","desc":"针对女子分段购票升一等座因车厢不互通全程只能站着一事，12306回应称，涉事列车为“加长版”高铁，两节车厢连接处不通，旅客需在车外换车厢且无法退差价，提醒旅客购票时留意。","cover":"https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/8b01ac607d48529a7ee32e7a2b427c0a","hot":"6472742","url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%8A%B1%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E7%AD%89%E5%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E9%92%B1+%E5%85%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%8D%B4%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%AB%99%E7%9D%80&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news","mobile_url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%8A%B1%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E7%AD%89%E5%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E9%92%B1+%E5%85%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%8D%B4%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E7%AB%99%E7%9D%80&sa=fyb_news&rsv_dl=fyb_news"},{"title":"女子每天玩手机10小时患手机痴呆症","desc":"福州一位25岁的王小姐从事网销，每日使用手机超10小时，渐渐健忘、注意力涣散。她就医检查，记忆力明显减退，被医生确诊患上数码痴呆症，也就是俗称的手机痴呆症。","cover":"https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/8bf2527500b7ab70f6816117b5a9944e","hot":"6374522","url":"https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A5%B